age_banner_3.jpg"}},{"id":"hobart_wv_the_lark_distillery","areaId":"hobart","name":"The Lark Distillery","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":-42.88292,"lng":147.33204},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"hobart_wv_the_lark_distillery","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://larkdistillery.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["thelarkdistillery","hobart"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"The Lark Distillery is the first licensed distillery in Tasmania since 1839 and now operates as a bar, store and distillery in one. It produces fine single malt whiskey and other liqueurs. It provides free tastings of liqueurs and spirits and charges a small fee to taste their 3 types of whiskeys ($2 each tasting or $5 for all 3). Their bush liqueur also has a distinctive taste through the use of ","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Hobart"},{"id":"hobart_wv_jackman_mcross","areaId":"hobart","name":"Jackman & McRoss","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":-42.88969,"lng":147.33346},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"hobart_wv_jackman_mcross","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.facebook.com/Jackman-and-McRoss-139201119459938/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["jackmanmcross","hobart"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"07:00","close":"17:00"},{"open":"07:00","close":"17:00"},{"open":"07:00","close":"17:00"},{"open":"07:00","close":"17:00"},{"open":"07:00","close":"17:00"},{"open":"07:00","close":"17:00"},{"open":"07:00","close":"17:00"}]},"summary":"A Hobart institution with fantastic bakery treats - a must visit when in town. Walk in and take one look at the counter display and you'll see why. Eat-in is table service with a different price list. Short walk from Salamanca Place - head up the stairs by the gallery, keep walking along the road and it's just on the right. You can't miss it, there will be lots of cars parked nearby.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Hobart"},{"id":"hobart_wv_the_shipwright_s_arms","areaId":"hobart","name":"The Shipwright's Arms","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":-42.8915,"lng":147.3366},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"hobart_wv_the_shipwright_s_arms","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["theshipwrightsarms","hobart"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"It's in Battery Point, one of Australia's oldest suburbs, the Arms opened in 1842. Cosy fires and Chesterfields is the atmosphere here and the nautical theme attracts participants in the Sydney-Hobart yacht race around the new year. A popular local pub, slightly off the tourist trail, the beer garden is an attractive place for a meal on summer evenings.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Hobart"},{"id":"hobart_wv_mures_fish_centre","areaId":"hobart","name":"Mures Fish Centre","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":-42.8823,"lng":147.334},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"hobart_wv_mures_fish_centre","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.mures.com.au/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["muresfishcentre","hobart"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Mures has two sections: the upper deck is a stylish seafood restaurant (mains $20-30); the lower deck is a cafeteria style bistro (mains approx $10) and served mainly deep fried fish and the like. Reservations are usually required for the upper deck. Coffee and ice-cream is also available in a casual environment on the lower deck.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Hobart"},{"id":"hobart_wv_mobius_lounge_bar","areaId":"hobart","name":"Mobius Lounge Bar","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":-42.8844,"lng":147.33097},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"hobart_wv_mobius_lounge_bar","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["mobiusloungebar","hobart"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Depending on who you ask, Mobius will be described as either the seediest or the best club in Hobart. The grumpy bouncers and reasonably seedy atmosphere though, can't detract from the fact that the DJs are clearly some of the best in Hobart and the dancefloor is regularly full.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Hobart"},{"id":"hobart_wv_the_new_sydney_hotel","areaId":"hobart","name":"The New Sydney Hotel","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":-42.8808,"lng":147.3254},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"hobart_wv_the_new_sydney_hotel","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["thenewsydneyhotel","hobart"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"One of the most popular inner-city pubs, the cosy New Sydney is home to Hobart's Irish community and offers an Irish pub atmosphere rather more authentic than that of an Irish theme pub (see Irish Murphy's, below). Large range of imported and local beers on tap.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Hobart"},{"id":"hobart_wv_irish_murphy_s","areaId":"hobart","name":"Irish Murphy's","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":-42.88659,"lng":147.33086},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"hobart_wv_irish_murphy_s","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.irishmurphys.com.au/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["irishmurphys","hobart"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Irish Murphy's is a busy Irish pub on one of the prime nightlife strips. It has a young crowd dancing to pop hits from their childhood in a fake Irish franchise pub. The meals are quite good, and there's a fantastic view over the old warehouses at Salamanca.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Hobart"},{"id":"hobart_wv_cargo_bar_lounge","areaId":"hobart","name":"Cargo Bar Lounge","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":-42.88687,"lng":147.33283},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"hobart_wv_cargo_bar_lounge","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.cargobarsalamanca.com.au/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["cargobarlounge","hobart"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Modern feel with a mix of outdoor seating on the street, or a quieter secluded booth style seating at the back of the bar. Drinks are the usual fare; a selection of beers on tap, a good choice of wines and most spirits.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Hobart"},{"id":"hobart_wv_tricycle_cafe","areaId":"hobart","name":"Tricycle Cafe","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":-42.8869,"lng":147.33356},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"hobart_wv_tricycle_cafe","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.tricyclecafe.com.au/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["tricyclecafe","hobart"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Outdoor dining on the Path with excellent coffee and outstanding muffins. Artisan sourdough, Tasmanian vintage cheeses with a cool vibe. Baked eggs with yoghurt and chutney are a surprising combination that works.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Hobart"},{"id":"hobart_wv_machine_laundry_cafe","areaId":"hobart","name":"Machine Laundry Cafe","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":-42.8876,"lng":147.33332},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"hobart_wv_machine_laundry_cafe","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Machine-Laundry-Cafe/113296732063100","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["machinelaundrycafe","hobart"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"07:30","close":"17:00"},{"open":"07:30","close":"17:00"},{"open":"07:30","close":"17:00"},{"open":"07:30","close":"17:00"},{"open":"07:30","close":"17:00"},{"open":"07:30","close":"17:00"},{"open":"08:30","close":"17:00"}]},"summary":"This cafe (which also houses a laundromat, hence the name) is a good place for a filling breakfast of $8-$15. Eggs benedict and banana and ricotta pancakes are recommended.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Hobart"},{"id":"hobart_wv_the_drunken_admiral","areaId":"hobart","name":"The Drunken Admiral","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":-42.8812,"lng":147.3349},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"hobart_wv_the_drunken_admiral","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://drunkenadmiral.com.au/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["thedrunkenadmiral","hobart"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Wonderful restaurant close to Mures. The seafood platter is highly recommended. It is important to make a reservation as this is a popular restaurant.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Hobart"},{"id":"hobart_wv_villino_espresso","areaId":"hobart","name":"Villino Espresso","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":-42.8814,"lng":147.32568},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"hobart_wv_villino_espresso","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.villino.com.au/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["villinoespresso","hobart"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"08:00","close":"16:30"},{"open":"08:00","close":"16:30"},{"open":"08:00","close":"16:30"},{"open":"08:00","close":"16:30"},{"open":"08:00","close":"16:30"},{"open":"09:00","close":"15:00"},null],"note":"Closed Sun"},"summary":"Small cafe in the CBD of Hobart. Good coffee made well and consistently.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Hobart"},{"id":"hobart_wv_ball_and_chain","areaId":"hobart","name":"Ball and Chain","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":